  "text": "The bridge sits on one face, so Br⁻ can only enter from the other. Ring: trans-1,2-dibromide, a racemate (attack at C1 or C2, and bridge on the top or bottom face, give the two mirror images equally). Open chain: anti addition to (E)-but-2-ene gives meso-2,3-dibromobutane; to (Z)-but-2-ene, the racemic (2R,3R)/(2S,3S) pair."
